<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<script>document.documentElement.className+=' js';</script>
<title>Table One Flooring — Flooring Installation | Gold Coast & Brisbane</title>
<meta name="description" content="Table One Flooring — reliable, tidy flooring installation across the Gold Coast and Brisbane. Call Rhys on 0413 508 518 for a free quote.">
<meta property="og:title" content="Table One Flooring">
<meta property="og:description" content="Flooring installation across the Gold Coast & Brisbane — reliable, tidy, top-notch workmanship. Call 0413 508 518.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="assets/favicon.png">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Michroma:wght@400;600;700&family=Reddit+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" media="print" onload="this.media='all'">
<noscript><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Michroma:wght@400;600;700&family=Reddit+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"></noscript>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#0F0D0B;
  --bg2:#161210;
  --ink:#F2EAE0;
  --muted:#B8A894;
  --line:rgba(229,184,126,.16);
  --accent:#C98A4B;
  --accent2:#E5B87E;
  --dark:#0A100D;
  --dark2:#0A100D;
  --dink:#F2F8F3;
  --dmut:#9CAFA2;
  --font-display:'Michroma',ui-serif,Georgia,serif;
  --font-sans:'Reddit Sans',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.62;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden}
img{max-width:100%;display:block}
a{color:inherit}
.wrap{width:min(1180px,92vw);margin-inline:auto}

html.js .drop{opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px);transition:opacity .7s ease-out,transform .7s ease-out}
html.js .drop.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  html.js .drop{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:none}
  *{animation-duration:.001s !important;transition-duration:.001s !important}
}

.nav{position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto 0;z-index:60;background:rgba(15,13,11,.97);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-bottom:2px solid var(--accent)}
.nav-in{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.4rem;height:80px}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.9rem;color:#fff;text-decoration:none}
.brand img{height:48px;width:auto;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;padding:4px}
.brand-name{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.28rem;line-height:1;color:#fff;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.02em}
.brand-sub{font-size:.56rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#E5B87E;font-weight:700}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:1.35rem;margin-left:auto;align-items:center}
.nav-links a{color:#B8A894;text-decoration:none;font-size:.92rem;font-weight:500}
.nav-links a:hover{color:#fff}
.nav-cta{background:var(--accent);color:#0B0F12 !important;padding:.55rem 1.2rem;border-radius:6px;font-weight:700}
.nav-cta:hover{filter:brightness(1.08)}
.burger{display:none;margin-left:auto;background:none;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);border-radius:6px;padding:.4rem .6rem;cursor:pointer}
.burger span{display:block;width:20px;height:2px;background:#fff;margin:4px 0;transition:.3s}
.burger.open span:nth-child(1){transform:translateY(6px) rotate(45deg)}
.burger.open span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}
.burger.open span:nth-child(3){transform:translateY(-6px) rotate(-45deg)}
@media(max-width:920px){
  .nav-links{position:fixed;inset:80px 0 auto 0;background:rgba(15,13,11,.97);flex-direction:column;padding:1.2rem;gap:1rem;transform:translateY(-140%);transition:transform .35s ease;border-bottom:2px solid var(--accent)}
  .nav-links.open{transform:none}
  .nav-links a{width:100%;text-align:center;padding:.5rem 0}
  .nav-cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:.3rem}
  .burger{display:block}
}

.hero{position:relative;min-height:95vh;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0F0D0B 0%,#161210 58%,#0F0D0B 100%);overflow:hidden;padding-top:80px}
.hero canvas{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block}
.hero-shade{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.02) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.03) 38%,rgba(6,10,8,.86) 100%);pointer-events:none}
.hero-in{position:relative;z-index:2;padding-block:12.5vh 3.4rem;width:100%}
.hero-kicker{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.65rem;color:#E5B87E;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.26em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:1rem}
.hero-kicker::before{content:"";width:36px;height:2px;background:var(--accent)}
.hero h1{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(2.3rem,5.8vw,4.5rem);line-height:1.06;color:#F7F0E6;font-weight:700;max-width:22ch;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#E5B87E}
.hero-sub{margin-top:1.1rem;color:#B8A894;font-size:clamp(.98rem,1.5vw,1.09rem);max-width:56ch}
.hero-cta{display:flex;gap:.9rem;margin-top:1.8rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;padding:.85rem 1.55rem;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;transition:transform .15s ease,filter .15s ease}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);filter:brightness(1.06)}
.btn-primary{background:var(--accent);color:#0B0F12}
.btn-ghost{border:1.5px solid rgba(242,248,243,.35);color:#F7F0E6}
.hero-strip{margin-top:2.6rem;display:flex;gap:2.6rem;flex-wrap:wrap;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);padding-top:1.2rem}
.hero-strip p{color:#7E9186;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700}
.hero-strip strong{display:block;color:#F7F0E6;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.05rem;margin-top:.2rem;font-weight:600}

section{padding-block:5.4rem}
.sec-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:2.4rem}
.sec-head::before{content:"";width:40px;height:3px;background:var(--accent);flex:none;align-self:center;border-radius:2px}
.sec-kicker{font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#E5B87E;font-weight:700}
.sec-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(1.75rem,4vw,2.7rem);font-weight:700;line-height:1.12;margin-top:.35rem;max-width:28ch;color:#F7F0E6;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.sec-sub{color:var(--muted);max-width:60ch;margin-top:.85rem}

.svc-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(288px,1fr));gap:1.15rem}
.svc{background:rgba(229,184,126,.06);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:1.65rem 1.5rem;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:border-color .2s ease,transform .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease}
.svc:hover{border-color:var(--accent);transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}
.svc::after{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:44px;height:3px;background:var(--accent);transition:width .3s ease}
.svc:hover::after{width:100%}
.svc-ico{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:9px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#C98A4B,#0F0D0B);display:grid;place-items:center;margin-bottom:.95rem}
.svc-ico svg{width:22px;height:22px;stroke:#151210;fill:none;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
.svc h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:1.12rem;color:#F7F0E6;margin-bottom:.35rem}
.svc p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.94rem}

.band{background:var(--dark);border-block:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14)}
.band .sec-title{color:var(--dink)}
.band .sec-kicker{color:#E5B87E}
.band .sec-sub{color:var(--dmut)}
.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(288px,1fr));gap:1.15rem}
.step{background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);border-radius:10px;padding:1.55rem 1.45rem}
.step-n{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.75rem;line-height:1;color:#E5B87E;margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:700}
.step h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:1.06rem;color:var(--dink);margin-bottom:.3rem}
.step p{color:var(--dmut);font-size:.92rem}

.why-block{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.46fr .54fr;gap:2.4rem;align-items:start}
@media(max-width:980px){.why-block{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}}
.why-list{display:grid;gap:1.05rem}
.why-item{display:flex;gap:.95rem;align-items:flex-start}
.why-tick{flex:none;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--accent);display:grid;place-items:center;margin-top:.2rem}
.why-tick svg{width:14px;height:14px;stroke:#0B0F12;fill:none;stroke-width:2.8;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
.why-item h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:1.08rem;color:#F7F0E6}
.why-item p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.93rem;margin-top:.1rem}
.why-visual{border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,.05),rgba(255,255,255,.02));padding:1.7rem;display:grid;place-items:center}
.why-visual img{width:min(330px,94%);border-radius:8px}
.why-visual p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:1rem;font-size:.88rem;text-align:center}

.tail{background:#161210;border-block:1px solid var(--line)}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.65rem;margin-top:1.3rem}
.chip{border:1px solid rgba(229,184,126,.3);border-radius:999px;padding:.5rem 1.15rem;font-size:.88rem;color:#E5B87E;background:rgba(229,184,126,.08);font-weight:600}
.tail-note{color:var(--muted);font-size:.93rem;margin-top:1.2rem}

.close-band{background:var(--dark);border-block:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);text-align:center}
.close-band .sec-head{justify-content:center;text-align:center}
.close-band .sec-head::before{display:none}
.close-band .sec-title{color:var(--dink);max-width:none;margin-inline:auto}
.close-band .sec-kicker{color:#E5B87E}
.close-band .cta-sub{color:var(--dmut);max-width:58ch;margin:1rem auto 0}
.cta-row{display:flex;gap:.9rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1.9rem}
.cta-lines{margin-top:1.6rem;display:flex;gap:2.2rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.cta-lines p{color:var(--dmut);font-size:.95rem}
.cta-lines a{color:var(--dink);text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
.cta-lines a:hover{color:#E5B87E}

footer{background:#0A0908;border-top:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);color:#B8A894;padding-block:4.2rem 2rem}
.foot-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr .6fr;gap:2.8rem}
@media(max-width:880px){.foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}}
.foot-brand{display:flex;gap:.9rem;align-items:center;margin-bottom:1.05rem}
.foot-brand img{height:52px;width:auto;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;padding:4px}
.foot-brand-name{font-family:var(--font-display);color:#F2F8F3;font-size:1.24rem;line-height:1;font-weight:700}
.foot-brand-sub{font-size:.56rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#E5B87E;font-weight:700}
.foot h4{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;color:#F2F8F3;font-size:1.06rem;margin-bottom:.8rem}
.foot p,.foot a{font-size:.93rem;line-height:1.85;color:#B8A894;text-decoration:none}
.foot a:hover{color:#F2F8F3}
.foot-bottom{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);padding-top:1.5rem;margin-top:3rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.79rem;color:#8F8272}
section#lbq{--lbq-bg:#0F0D0B;--lbq-ink:#F2EAE0;--lbq-muted:#B8A894;--lbq-panel:rgba(229,184,126,.06);--lbq-line:rgba(229,184,126,.16);--lbq-accent:#C98A4B}
</style>
<style id="lb-brand-css">
/* ==== LB BRAND (logo-true spanning wordmark) ==== */
.lb-brand{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:clamp(9px,1vw,16px);text-decoration:none;
 color:inherit;min-width:0;padding:0;background:none;border:0;flex:0 1 auto}
.lb-brand__mark{flex:0 0 auto;display:block;height:clamp(34px,4.1vw,58px);width:auto;max-width:22vw}
.lb-brand__mark img{display:block;height:100%;width:auto;max-width:22vw;object-fit:contain}
.lb-brand__word{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;min-width:0;line-height:.94}
.lb-brand__name{font-family:var(--lb-disp,Inter),sans-serif;font-weight:500;text-transform:uppercase;
 font-size:clamp(21px,2.75vw,44px);letter-spacing:.004em;white-space:nowrap;line-height:.92;
 color:var(--lb-name,currentColor)}
.lb-brand__name .lb-acc{color:var(--lb-acc,currentColor)}
.lb-brand__sub{font-family:var(--lb-sub,Inter),sans-serif;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;
 font-size:clamp(7px,.82vw,12px);letter-spacing:.30em;white-space:nowrap;margin-top:.34em;
 color:var(--lb-subc,currentColor);opacity:.86}
.lb-brand__rule{display:block;height:3px;width:100%;margin-top:.5em;border-radius:2px;
 background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--lb-acc,currentColor),transparent)}
@media (max-width:640px){
 .lb-brand__mark{height:clamp(30px,8vw,40px)}
 .lb-brand__name{font-size:clamp(18px,6.2vw,26px)}
 .lb-brand__sub{letter-spacing:.2em;font-size:7px}
}
</style>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Caveat:wght@600;700&family=Montserrat:wght@400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
<nav class="nav" aria-label="Main">
  <div class="wrap nav-in">
    <a class="lb-brand" href="#top" aria-label="Table One - Home" style="--lb-disp:Caveat;--lb-sub:Montserrat;--lb-acc:#6c3c24;"><span class="lb-brand__word"><span class="lb-brand__name">Table One</span><span class="lb-brand__sub">— FLOORING —</span><span class="lb-brand__rule" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></a>
    <button class="burger" id="burger" aria-label="Toggle menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="navlinks">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </button>
    <div class="nav-links" id="navlinks">
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#process">How we work</a>
      <a href="#areas">Get a quote</a>
      <a class="nav-cta" href="#quote">Get a quote</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero" id="top">
  <canvas id="heroCanvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="hero-shade"></div>
  <div class="wrap hero-in">
    <p class="hero-kicker">Gold Coast & Brisbane · Flooring</p>
    <h1>Floors that finish the room, <em>properly.</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Flooring installation across the Gold Coast and Brisbane — reliable, tidy, and committed to top-notch workmanship.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="tel:+61413508518">Call 0413 508 518</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#quote">Get a quote</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-strip">
      <p><strong>Supply & install</strong>one team, one job</p>
      <p><strong>Homes & units</strong>single rooms to whole homes</p>
      <p><strong>Tidy work</strong>clean finish guaranteed</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="t1f-services" id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head drop">
      <div>
        <p class="sec-kicker">Services</p>
        <h2 class="sec-title">Flooring done clean and straight.</h2>
        <p class="sec-sub">Installation with the care of someone who has to look at it every day.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-grid">
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="6" width="18" height="4" rx="1"/><rect x="3" y="13" width="18" height="4" rx="1"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Flooring installation</h3>
        <p>New floors laid clean, level and built to last.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l9 5-9 5-9-5z"/><path d="M3 13l9 5 9-5"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Supply & install</h3>
        <p>Flooring supplied and installed in one go — no juggling suppliers.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 11l8-7 8 7"/><path d="M6 10v10h12V10"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Homes & units</h3>
        <p>From a single room to a whole home or unit.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16"/><path d="M8 8h2M14 8h2M8 12h2M14 12h2M8 16h8"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Commercial spaces</h3>
        <p>Floors for shops, offices and workspaces that cop real traffic.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="9" width="18" height="6" rx="1"/><path d="M7 9v3M11 9v3M15 9v3"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Measure & quote</h3>
        <p>On-site measure and a clear, itemised quote.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l1.8 5.2L19 10l-5.2 1.8L12 17l-1.8-5.2L5 10l5.2-1.8z"/><path d="M18 16l.9 2.1L21 19l-2.1.9L18 22l-.9-2.1L15 19l2.1-.9z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Clean finish</h3>
        <p>Sites left clean and ready to walk on when the job is done.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="t1f-approach band" id="process">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head drop">
      <div>
        <p class="sec-kicker">How we work</p>
        <h2 class="sec-title">Measured, quoted, installed.</h2>
        <p class="sec-sub">No guesswork — a proper process from start to finish.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step drop"><p class="step-n">01</p><h3>Get in touch</h3><p>Tell us about the space and what you have in mind.</p></div>
      <div class="step drop"><p class="step-n">02</p><h3>Measure & quote</h3><p>On-site measure and a clear, itemised quote.</p></div>
      <div class="step drop"><p class="step-n">03</p><h3>Installation</h3><p>Floors laid level, clean and straight — proper prep underneath.</p></div>
      <div class="step drop"><p class="step-n">04</p><h3>Walk-through</h3><p>We check the finish together and you get to enjoy the new floor.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="t1f-why" id="why">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="why-block">
      <div class="drop">
        <p class="sec-kicker">Why Table One</p>
        <h2 class="sec-title" style="margin-top:.35rem">Workmanship you can stand on.</h2>
        <div class="why-list" style="margin-top:1.6rem">
          <div class="why-item">
            <span class="why-tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"/></svg></span>
            <div><h3>Gold Coast & Brisbane</h3><p>Based locally, working across both cities.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="why-item">
            <span class="why-tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"/></svg></span>
            <div><h3>Reliable</h3><p>Turns up when agreed and keeps you across progress.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="why-item">
            <span class="why-tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"/></svg></span>
            <div><h3>Tidy work</h3><p>Careful installation and a clean site at the end.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="why-item">
            <span class="why-tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"/></svg></span>
            <div><h3>Top-notch workmanship</h3><p>Committed to a finish you will be happy with for years.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="why-visual drop">
        <img src="assets/work.jpg" alt="Table One Flooring">
        <p>Table One Flooring — Gold Coast & Brisbane.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="t1f-areas tail" id="areas">
  <div class="wrap" style="padding-block:3.8rem">
    <div class="sec-head drop" style="margin-bottom:1rem">
      <div>
        <p class="sec-kicker">Service areas</p>
        <h2 class="sec-title">Gold Coast & Brisbane.</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="chips drop">
      <span class="chip">Gold Coast</span>
      <span class="chip">Brisbane</span>
      <span class="chip">Surrounding suburbs</span>
    </div>
    <p class="tail-note drop">Not sure if we cover your area? Call Rhys on 0413 508 518.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="foot">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="foot-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="foot-brand">
